      "descs": [
        {
          "lang": "da",
          "subject": "Platform nedtages og fjernes. Undervandsarbejde",
          "details": "<p><strong>I perioden 1. juli - 1. september 2024</strong>, nedtages og fjernes platformen p&aring; n&aelig;vnte postion. I forbindelse med nedtagningen udf&oslash;res der undervandsarbejde.</p>\n<ul class=\"positions\">\n<li>55&deg; 52,795'N - 004&deg; 13,993'E, Platform RAVN.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p>Arbejdet udf&oslash;res af fart&oslash;jerne&nbsp;&raquo;GULLIVER&laquo; (LXGK) og &raquo;MULTRATUG&laquo; (PCDB) som begge kan kontaktes p&aring; VHF kanal 16.</p>\n<p>Skibsfarten anmodes om at vise hensyn ved passage.&nbsp;</p>"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "subject": "Platform to be dismantled and removed. Subsea work",
          "details": "<p><strong>In the period 1 July - 1 September 2024</strong>,&nbsp; the platform at the mentioned position will be dismantled and removed. In connection with the dismantling, subsea work is performed.</p>\n<ul class=\"positions\">\n<li>55&deg; 52.795'N - 004&deg; 13.993'E, Platform RAVN.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p>The work will be carried out by the vessels \"GULLIVER\" (LXGK) and \"MULTRATUG\" (PCDB), both of which can be contacted on VHF&nbsp;channel 16.</p>\n<p>Mariners are requested to pass with caution.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "hideSubject": true
    }
